{"t":"MTB","n":"M&T Bank Corporation","nKo":"M&T은행","ex":"NYSE","cur":"USD","px":211.6,"chg":3.3,"chgPct":0.01584,"prev":208.3,"dayH":215.53,"dayL":209.25,"w52H":255.95,"w52L":185.84,"vol":817479,"avgVol":771000,"mcap":30350727168,"pe":11.06,"fpe":10.03,"eps":19.14,"feps":21.1,"pb":1.21,"div":7.2,"divY":0.034,"beta":0.64,"short":4929491,"shortPct":0.0399,"shortRatio":4.87,"prof":{"c":"United States","cKo":"미국","s":"Financial Services","sKo":"금융 서비스","i":"Banks - Regional","iKo":"은행 - 지역","city":"Buffalo","emp":21562,"web":"https://www.mtb.com","sum":"M&T Bank Corporation operates as a bank holding company for Manufacturers and Traders Trust Company and Wilmington Trust, National Association that provides retail and commercial banking products and services in the United States. The company operates through three segments: Commercial Bank, Retail Bank, and Institutional Services and Wealth Management. It offers a range of credit products and banking services, such as commercial lending and leasing, letters of credits, deposit products, cash management services, commercial real estate loans, and credit facilities secured by various commercial real estate properties to middle-market and large commercial customers. The company also provides customers deposit products, including demand, savings and time accounts, and other services; automobi","sumKo":"M&T Bank Corporation은 미국에서 소매 및 상업 은행 상품과 서비스를 제공하는 Manufacturer and Traders Trust Company 및 Wilmington Trust, National Association의 은행 지주 회사로 운영됩니다. 이 회사는 상업 은행, 소매 은행, 기관 서비스 및 자산 관리의 세 가지 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 상업용 대출 및 리스, 신용장, 예금 상품, 현금 관리 서비스, 상업용 부동산 대출, 다양한 상업용 부동산을 담보로 하는 신용 ​​시설 등 다양한 신용 상품 및 은행 서비스를 중견 시장 및 대규모 상업 고객에게 제공합니다. 회사는 또한 수요, 저축, 시간 계좌 및 기타 서비스를 포함한 예금 상품을 고객에게 제공합니다. 자동차"},"fin":{"annual":[{"y":2022,"rev":8178559000,"ni":1891480000},{"y":2023,"rev":9643000000,"ni":2636000000},{"y":2024,"rev":9279000000,"ni":2449000000},{"y":2025,"rev":9690000000,"ni":2699000000}],"quarterly":[{"q":"4Q2025","rev":2475000000,"ni"